  "content": {
    "id": "p31-q28-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "28",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{x^2-4x-12}{x-6}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x+2$, $x\\ne6$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-4x-12}{x-6}&=\\frac{(x-6)(x+2)}{x-6}\\\\\\frac{x^2-4x-12}{x-6}&=x+2.\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominator requires $x\\ne6$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 20
  },
